still breathing running on fumes sealed in the tomb dragging my feet to the beat taste of the rust rising above the dust ’cause i’m still here choking on fear about to snap so burn it all leave it all behind blinded by the hate i’m taking back my fate this iron drinks the life right out of me i made this bed of stone now let me sleep it tears me down but feeds the hungry will it keeps me cool and keeps me standing still a wrench in the gears grinding the fear out of my mind crossing the line the vision dies im going blind but im still here building up past the fear dressed to kill let it burn no return standing still by sheer force of will piece by piece bone by bone i build this hell on my own piece by piece skin for skin let the nightmare begin oh fuck it hurts like hell cannot catch a breath lights go low pulse comes loose it calls my name i must refuse ’cause i’m still here breathing through the fear about to snap falcons call fuck it all i won’t fall i must carry on i won’t fall for that i must carry on i won’t fall for that i must carry on i won’t fall for that i must carry on i won’t fall fuck that